// One quality lens of the emotion detection case study, argued on its own.
//
// This brick knows nothing about the other two. That is the point: somebody who cares
// about fairness wrote it, and never had to agree with anybody about anything except the
// wording of the artifacts it cites.

justification fair {

    conclusion claim is "The classifier is fair"
    strategy   flip  is "The flip-rate is below 10%"

    evidence counterfactual is "The counterfactual dataset is trustworthy"
    evidence model         is "The trained model is available"

    flip           supports claim
    counterfactual supports flip
    model          supports flip

}
